# PowerHubModule
Simple fused digital switching
Increased pad size for easier hand soldering
## Git contents
Design files: 
-- Schematic
-- Fusion360 native project files
-- 3D model .obj
-- electrical library for custom parts
-- Dimensional drawing

Manufacturing files:
-- Gerbers for PCB fab
-- BOM for ordering from Digikey

## Electrical Specifications
Input voltage range: 2.5-20V
Maxiumum output voltage limit: 80V
Gate capacitance: 4.5uF max


Connect multiple modules together with a bus bar for a custom fusebox. Ground the control pin to turn on, or bypass the MOSFET with 14awg wire for constant power

For trouble-free operation, it is highly recommended that you protect the Module's FET with a TVS diode like MPN: TP6KE22A or SM30T18AY

Inductive loads like relays without flyback diodes can cause damaging voltage spikes when shut off 


